[4641]="7000BF0F\n1\tDefeat Gauradan wind-masters (total: 4)\030Defeat Gauradan wolf-born (total: 8)\tThe Gauradan hunters can be found throughout the southern reaches of High-pass. Thorgest has asked you to throw the Gauradan hunters off his trail by defeating several of them before they find his dwelling.\n2\tTalk to Thorgest\tYou should return to Thorgest at Hrimbarg in central High-pass and tell him that the Gauradan hunters have been defeated.\n",
[4642]="7005AFFF\n1\tElusive foes can be found at Azanulbizar. King Thráin has asked you to find and defeat one of the elusive foes rumoured to have been spotted at Azanulbizar.\t\n2\tTalk to King Thráin at Amdân\tKing Thráin can be found at Amdân. You have defeated one of the elusive foes rumoured to have been spotted at Azanulbizar. You should return to King Thráin.\n",
