[4646]="7002483A\n1\tDeliver the albino fur to Maegamiel at Echad Mirobel in southern Eregion\030Collect albino fur (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver albino fur from the beasts far to the north and east of Echad Mirobel to Maegamiel. Maegamiel defends Echad Mirobel in the southern area of Eregion.\n",
